    "detailed_description": "<strong> [Characteristics of this work]</strong><br>The story revolves around a conversation between the main character Kanata and the main heroine Nozomi on a train.<br>The story branches into three different routes (junior high school, high school and university) by following Nozomi's past.<br>The heroine and protagonist differ depending on the chapter.<br>Reaching the true end of each chapter reveals Nozomi's past, try and experience all the branching paths.<br><br><br><strong>[Story]</strong><br>Kanata takes the same train at the same time again today to see a friend.<br>Her name was Nozomi, and they became good friends. She would talk about stories of 3 pairs of men and women and their &quot;lies&quot;.<br>As Kanata hears Nozomi's voice, he begins to question and dive into these &quot;big lies&quot;.<br><br><br><strong> [Scenario Creator]</strong><br>At the Tyrano Game Festival, he has won the &quot;Secondary Grand Prix&quot; and &quot;Mystery/Mystery Solving Division Excellence Award&quot;.<br>&quot;Nice to meet you, my girlfriend&quot;, &quot;I want to give you my heart&quot;, &quot;I fall in love with your fake&quot;, &quot;Test return&quot;, &quot;Only I know&quot;, &quot;If I could become an invisible man&quot;, &quot;World series&quot;, etc. This is an original scenario by Mr. Nike, who has created many moving scenarios.",
